tle":"axum and ws","sub":"Upgrade in a handler","short":"axum ws","main":"WebSocketUpgrade is an extractor; on_upgrade gets the socket; recv and send work with Message.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Extractor","on_upgrade","Message"],"captions":["WebSocketUpgrade is an ordinary handler extractor","on_upgrade gets the ready socket and lives in its own task","recv() reads, send() writes; Message is text, bytes, ping, pong, close"],"frames":[[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["async fn ws(upgrade: WebSocketUpgrade) -> Response {","    upgrade.on_upgrade(handle)","}"],"hl":[0,1],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":28.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["async fn handle(mut socket: WebSocket) {","    while let Some(Ok(msg)) = socket.recv().await {","        // handle the message","    }","}   // end of function = end of connection"],"hl":[1,4],"lang":"rust","size":8.5,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}],[{"t":"code","id":"c","x":10.0,"y":20.0,"lines":["match msg {","    Message::Text(t) => { .. }","    Message::Close(_) => break,","    _ => {}   // the library handles ping/pong itself","}"],"hl":[1,2,3],"lang":"rust","size":9.0,"lh":22.0,"w":340.0}]],"cues":[12.4,24.8]}]},{"title":"split","sub":"Reading and writing apart","short":"split","main":"The socket is split into receiver and sender: one task reads, the other writes; an error in either ends both.","body":[{"t":"scene","labels":["Two activities","split()","End both"],"captions":["Reading the client's commands and writing its events are independent","sender and receiver in different tasks; needs SinkExt and StreamExt","When either ends, stop the other, or an orphan task is left behind"],"frames":[[{"t":"cell","id":"a","x":70.0,"y":50.0,"w":100.0,"h":26.0,"text":"commands ←","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"b","x":70.0,"y":100.0,"w":100.0,"h":26.0,"text":"events →","tone":"blue","size":10.5,"sub_size":8.5},{"t":"cell","id":"c","x":270.0,"y":75.0,"w":110.0,"h":30.0,"t